---

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2>I like the space where data, design, and software overlap.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>
          I'm a seventh-semester B.Sc. Data Science student at Telkom University. I tend to enjoy projects where the technical work is only part of the problem: the analysis has to be understood, the system has to fit real constraints, and the final result has to be usable by someone else.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before university, I studied Software Engineering at SMK Telkom Purwokerto. That background in web development, databases, and interface design still shapes how I work today, whether I'm building a data product, mapping an urban problem, or directing a visual system.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="honors reveal">
        <div class="honor-item">
          <div class="h-label">Current</div>
          <div class="h-value">B.Sc. Data Science · Telkom University</div>
        </div>
        <div class="honor-item">
          <div class="h-label">Honors</div>
          <div class="h-value">Astra 1st 2026 Scholarship Awardee<br />Telkom University Endowment Fund 2026 Awardee</div>
        </div>
        <div class="honor-item">
          <div class="h-label">Interested in</div>
          <div class="h-value">Data products · Urban analytics · Decision intelligence · Visual communication</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 90px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about-grid p {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 22px 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .honors { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .honor-item {
    padding: 18px 0 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .honor-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .honor-item .h-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: 7px;
  }
  .honor-item .h-value { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
